intro.body:
SwiGLU 用三个矩阵：gate 投影、up 投影、down 投影，门控函数是 Swish（即 SiLU）。

```python
class SwiGLUFFN(nn.Module):
    def __init__(self, dim, hidden_dim=None):
        super().__init__()
        if hidden_dim is None:
            hidden_dim = int(2 * (4 * dim) / 3)
            hidden_dim = ((hidden_dim + 255) // 256) * 256
        self.w1 = nn.Linear(dim, hidden_dim, bias=False)
        self.w2 = nn.Linear(hidden_dim, dim, bias=False)
        self.w3 = nn.Linear(dim, hidden_dim, bias=False)
    def forward(self, x):
        return self.w2(F.silu(self.w1(x)) * self.w3(x))
```

把组件拼成一个 LLaMA 解码器块，就是 Pre-RMSNorm + GQA（含 RoPE）+ 残差，再 Pre-RMSNorm + SwiGLU + 残差：

```python
class LlamaDecoderBlock(nn.Module):
    def __init__(self, dim, n_heads, n_kv_heads, norm_eps=1e-6):
        super().__init__()
        self.attention = GroupedQueryAttention(dim, n_heads, n_kv_heads)
        self.feed_forward = SwiGLUFFN(dim)
        self.attention_norm = RMSNorm(dim, eps=norm_eps)
        self.ffn_norm = RMSNorm(dim, eps=norm_eps)
    def forward(self, x, freqs_cis, mask=None):
        h = x + self.attention(self.attention_norm(x), freqs_cis, mask)
        return h + self.feed_forward(self.ffn_norm(h))
```

这就是现代 LLM 的标准积木：归一化在子层前、注意力含 RoPE 与 GQA、前馈用 SwiGLU、全程 Pre-Norm 加残差。
